-- title:
--   Residue field at the q-adic place is generated by constants
-- statement:
--   Let $L$ be a field, let $F$ be an intermediate field of the extension $L \subseteq L((q))$ of the field of formal Laurent series over $L$, and suppose there exists $j \in F$ whose underlying Laurent series $\mathrm{qSeriesBar}\,L\,F\,j$ has Hahn-series order $-1$. Under this hypothesis `qInftyPlaceBar L F h` is the place of $F$ over $L$ whose valuation subring is `qIntegersBar L F`, the subring of those $f \in F$ whose underlying Laurent series has order $\ge 0$ (a valuation subring of $F$ containing the image of $L$, proper, and a principal ideal ring, the last two facts using the element $j$); recall that a `Place` in this development is by definition a valuation subring of $F$ containing $\mathrm{algebraMap}\,L\,F(L)$, distinct from the whole of $F$, and such that the subring is a principal ideal ring. Its residue field is the quotient of that valuation subring by its maximal ideal. The assertion is that the structure map $L \to$ `(qInftyPlaceBar L F h).ResidueField` is surjective; no injectivity statement is made here.
--
--   This is the computation of the residue field at the $q$-adic (cusp-at-infinity) place of a function field presented inside $L((q))$: the place has residue degree one over $L$. It is used in the construction of centred parameters at the cusp for integral models of modular curves of full level.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_surjective_algebraMap_residueField_bar.lean

import Definitions.Def_ModularCurve_QAdicPlace

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

open ModularCurve AlgebraicCurve

theorem ModularCurve.surjective_algebraMap_residueField_bar (L : Type*) [Field L] {F : IntermediateField L (LaurentSeries L)} (h : ∃ j : F, (qSeriesBar L F j).order = -1) : Function.Surjective (algebraMap L (qInftyPlaceBar L F h).ResidueField) := by sorry
